&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当社、筑豊電気鉄道㈱&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:30pt;min-height:30pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;バス事業&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;タクシー事業&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当社、西鉄バス北九州㈱、西鉄観光バス㈱、亀の井バス㈱&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;福岡西鉄タクシー㈱、久留米西鉄タクシー㈱、北九西鉄タクシー㈱&lt;/p&gt;
