&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:34pt;"&gt;48,442百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:34pt;"&gt;36,136百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:14.3pt;min-height:14.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;契約資産&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:34pt;"&gt;1,918百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:34pt;"&gt;2,931百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:8pt;font-size:8pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfNotesAndAccountsReceivableTradeAndContractAssetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfContractLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt;"&gt;※２  前受金、その他及び長期預り保証金のうち、契約負債の金額は次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
