  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;text-indent:8pt;"&gt;(1) 有形固定資産の減価償却累計額は445,756百万円です。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfReductionEntryOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(2) 有形固定資産の取得価額から控除した工事負担金等の圧縮記帳累計額は162,362百万円です。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfReductionEntryOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(1) 有形固定資産の減価償却累計額は445,493百万円です。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
