  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNonOperatingIncomeAndNonOperatingExpensesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※１　関係会社に係わるものは次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
